1
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:08,102
Good morning, I'm Anders Fjell, and this is Nordic Crypto.

2
00:00:08,706 --> 00:00:13,205
This week: Binance reports net outflows of three point six
four billion dollars.

3
00:00:13,205 --> 00:00:16,023
North Korea rejects the FBI's attribution.

4
00:00:16,023 --> 00:00:19,896
And Norges Bank says it wants to be ready if a digital
currency is needed.

5
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:27,691
Binance says customers withdrew a net of about three point
six four billion dollars on the first of November, after

6
00:00:27,691 --> 00:00:28,710
withdrawals reopened.

7
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:31,466
E24 reported the exchange's figures.

8
00:00:32,066 --> 00:00:36,022
North Korea rejects the FBI's statement that it was behind
the Binance theft.

9
00:00:36,022 --> 00:00:39,844
Aftenposten reports a statement calling the claim an absurd
fabrication.

10
00:00:39,844 --> 00:00:42,948
That is North Korea's position, not a new finding.

11
00:00:43,558 --> 00:00:49,403
At Norwegian exchange Firi, trading the day after the hack
was more than double a typical day, according to figures the

12
00:00:49,403 --> 00:00:50,434
firm shared with E24.

13
00:00:50,434 --> 00:00:54,020
The chief executive says it is too early to call it a
lasting shift.

14
00:00:54,618 --> 00:00:59,855
Norges Bank sees no current need for a retail digital
currency, but wants to be ready if that changes.

15
00:00:59,855 --> 00:01:03,134
Torbjørn Hægeland told a conference, Kaupr reports.

16
00:01:03,134 --> 00:01:06,545
A digital euro would not by itself decide it, he said.

17
00:01:07,142 --> 00:01:12,566
The same official said banks should prepare a tokenisation
strategy, and that important settlement should use central

18
00:01:12,566 --> 00:01:13,076
bank money.

19
00:01:13,076 --> 00:01:14,981
Kaupr reported the speech.

20
00:01:15,586 --> 00:01:21,793
Norwegian exchange NBX has raised at least thirty-four
million kroner from LDA Capital since 2022, by Kaupr's count

21
00:01:21,793 --> 00:01:23,681
of the company's own announcements.

22
00:01:23,681 --> 00:01:26,479
The latest issue closed on the third of November.

23
00:01:27,078 --> 00:01:32,347
Investornytt reports that Hyperliquid took in seven hundred
and thirteen million dollars over twelve months, citing

24
00:01:32,347 --> 00:01:33,401
Bloomberg Businessweek.

25
00:01:33,401 --> 00:01:37,366
Founder Jeff Yan wants to reach US traders through regulated
partners.

26
00:01:39,570 --> 00:01:45,168
Safello reported a third-quarter operating profit of zero
point eight million Swedish kronor, Kaupr reports from the

27
00:01:45,168 --> 00:01:46,036
company's figures.

28
00:01:46,036 --> 00:01:48,321
Revenue fell forty-one percent.

29
00:01:48,926 --> 00:01:54,921
Ulricehamns Tidning reports that one point five million
Swedish kronor in crypto was transferred in a romance scam.

30
00:01:54,921 --> 00:01:58,866
The public excerpt does not establish that anyone has been
charged or convicted.

31
00:01:59,482 --> 00:02:05,702
Virtune listed an AI crypto index ETP on the third of
November, in Stockholm and on Xetra, Kaupr reports.

32
00:02:05,702 --> 00:02:08,899
Its sales chief called software agents a growth driver.

33
00:02:08,899 --> 00:02:10,743
That is the company's view.

34
00:02:11,358 --> 00:02:16,021
Tesla, SpaceX and others have objected to their shares being
offered as tokens on OKXICE.

35
00:02:16,021 --> 00:02:18,265
Kryptovalutaguiden reported it.

36
00:02:18,265 --> 00:02:21,964
By CoinDesk's tally, the number of objections rose to
fifty-six.

37
00:02:22,562 --> 00:02:27,481
Firi says the temporary lay-offs it announced in August will
last until the end of March 2027.

38
00:02:27,481 --> 00:02:31,979
Chief executive Thuc Hoang told Kaupr that trading this year
has been lower than planned.

39
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:38,495
Sweden's Economic Crime Authority has charged two former
Valuno executives with aggravated insider trading, Kaupr

40
00:02:38,495 --> 00:02:38,913
reports.

41
00:02:38,913 --> 00:02:40,798
No one has been convicted.

42
00:02:40,798 --> 00:02:44,528
The former chief executive denies wrongdoing, according to
SvD.

43
00:02:45,138 --> 00:02:50,744
Goobit has signed an agreement with Kvarn Metals for gold in
its planned Futureproof platform, the company told Kaupr.

44
00:02:50,744 --> 00:02:54,166
Goobit says the gold is backed one to one by physical gold.

45
00:02:56,382 --> 00:03:02,056
Binance says the attackers used a fake job interview in
September, then misused an internal tool on an engineer's

46
00:03:02,056 --> 00:03:02,408
laptop.

47
00:03:02,408 --> 00:03:07,223
DR reported the exchange's account, and that Binance says
most of the losses have been covered.

48
00:03:07,826 --> 00:03:09,876
That's all for issue number six.

49
00:03:09,876 --> 00:03:12,581
Every story is at nordiccrypto.no.

50
00:03:12,581 --> 00:03:15,010
Nothing here is investment advice.

51
00:03:16,802 --> 00:03:18,330
I'm Anders Fjell.

52
00:03:18,330 --> 00:03:19,918
See you next week.

